# Listing Engine

## Entry

- **Not a top-level tab.** BizStart Germany → `listingEngine` screen (`StepListingEngine` → `ListingEngineBuilder`).
- Nested like TailorCV / Website-Rechtliches.

## Principles

- V1 scope: German Copywriter · SEO/item-specifics checklist · Compliance · Profit calculator · Publish Readiness Score.
- Never invent specs, GPSR, shipping times, certifications, or legal text.
- Legal modules (Impressum, Widerruf, AGB, Datenschutz) are locked templates — insert only.
- Human approval required; no auto-publish to eBay.
- Client-side `mergeComplianceGuards` after LLM compliance; RED claims stripped from marketing text.
- Compliance failure caps quality score (`finalizeScore`); Publish Readiness can block approval.
- Profit fees are **estimates** — not live eBay API. Do not claim official fee accuracy.
- Do not build V2/V3 ops (stock sync, A/B, analytics, Terapeak clone) without an explicit product decision.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `lib/listingengine/schema.js` | Product / listing / compliance / economics schemas |
| `lib/listingengine/prompts/*` | Extract, copywriter, compliance prompts |
| `lib/listingengine/api.js` | InvokeLLM pipeline via `/api/llm` |
| `lib/listingengine/validateClaims.js` | Risky-claim guards |
| `lib/listingengine/profit.js` | Contribution margin calculator |
| `lib/listingengine/seoCheck.js` | Title + Artikelmerkmale checklist |
| `lib/listingengine/publishReadiness.js` | Publish Readiness Score gate |
| `lib/listingengine/legalInsert.js` | Load locked legal from Website-Rechtliches |
| `lib/listingengine/exportListing.js` | Customer listing + internal notes |
| `lib/listingengine/store.js` | `scanlogic_listingengine_session` localStorage |

## Do not

- Put Anthropic keys in `VITE_*`.
- Let AI rewrite locked legal modules.
- Register Listing Engine as a suite `TabBar` tab without product decision.
- Auto-publish listings to eBay.
- Invent SEO title attributes not present in product data.
